# SHA-256 of each ruled text as a constant in scripts/check_crosswalks.py.
# These texts were ruled on 2026-09-01 and are required verbatim in the files
# the validator names. Render equality cannot detect an edit to a text that the
# render itself emits, so this file is the fixed point: editing a ruled text
# without editing this file fails the gate, and editing both is a diff a
# reviewer sees. Regenerating this file to silence a red is the one thing it
# exists to prevent.

